pp_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1804388830603763"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2132025900772502", "locale": "tr_TR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "2_MountainSiege.png", "id": "2277372492832957", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830576_2277372496166290_6732426521654110060_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RJbNGgRfVdgQ7kNvwH4W-9o&_nc_oc=Adq_eYpLohuZBXPy1Nw9Q72a-WczCWAl3KKfJzRyO4OXx3ROTOh6n1cVhaAryMzaWaY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQCuMhEeWP-gzjzQPJENM3m-Ipoy_T9pUuUhJZYoxeD6Q&oe=6AF887B7"}, {"file_name": "1_GateCaptain.png", "id": "1415117494145887", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673573223_1415117497479220_8835512145596870968_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5dFdkhL8wwkQ7kNvwGPzWpH&_nc_oc=AdroHkfT1Y1p9gverCIKNpGtUC1z5BalVege8PInyNhvfbQI-k7X21vas5IBMeQ--XQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTyFalVF9ivxFlv4Qo3N_s50EtTZbXZl0JBGS_uPvbVTA&oe=6AF87DBB"}, {"file_name": "3_BannerCaptain.png", "id": "1840211377643755", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673751957_1840211380977088_5467552198576485610_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lv4vnij9j1sQ7kNvwHsFknu&_nc_oc=AdoaenxTiNm05mDQiFU77RwcPOxf-IX_TXHsxvTsCv-ceLr34gsn4uMJGRrUYV1MFLM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQWuirnEmePhECkDJ3uJ8IzvF2o9qPlV2BZHRapx-6cqA&oe=6AF89351"}, {"file_name": "5_TowerVolley.png", "id": "1786967612423182", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/741360331_1786967615756515_3350735107050216934_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dVMuKcKMze0Q7kNvwFUq1YB&_nc_oc=AdoUJsV4O7wlMAKxOXSM1kH0EDx0V5t3qaAwWp3o3CtF7h6SXopgA3DFzoAGYdd7UeQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ2w3Njau5_zAVGOZUjPxq0AnM2WEy8yAxCozS5sq_VEA&oe=6AF87EA5"}, {"file_name": "4_SteelClaw.png", "id": "1127095273169667", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_1127095276503000_5095226129783355154_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AF2on7UeN6UQ7kNvwFMX_ue&_nc_oc=Adr8XREzt5z37nsAAl8WZ6put4lCwPMC0_qm3eeTqefnmv9AHLMS41FmIIN2Yw6dQOo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSMtIKmAJtrjuyCAL2EOtWCsFjCw8kyfnrKNu8Z6x4Dhw&oe=6AF88D37"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Kale Muhaf\u0131z\u0131 VR - Castle Guardian", "keywords": ["ok\u00e7uluk", "kalesavunmas\u0131", "ku\u015fatma", "sel\u00e7uklu", "yay"], "long_description": "Surlardaki yerini al, yay\u0131n\u0131 \u00e7ek ve kap\u0131n d\u00fc\u015fmeden orduyu durdur. Kale Muhaf\u0131z\u0131 VR, Sel\u00e7uklu esintili bir kale savunma oyunu.\n\n\u2022 Kale Kap\u0131s\u0131\u2019ndan Alacakaranl\u0131k Ge\u00e7idi, Sancak Tepesi ve Ku\u015fatma \u00c7emberi\u2019ne uzanan 14 b\u00f6l\u00fcm. Eski b\u00f6l\u00fcmlerde de kule ok\u00e7ular\u0131, manc\u0131n\u0131k bataryalar\u0131 ve farkl\u0131 b\u00f6l\u00fcm sonu liderleri var. Kara Arslan 11. b\u00f6l\u00fcmde seni bekliyor.\n\u2022 Her tehdide farkl\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131k ver: kulenin tekerleklerini k\u0131r, manc\u0131n\u0131\u011f\u0131n halat\u0131n\u0131 vurarak at\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 kes, komutanlar\u0131n deste\u011fini durdur ve z\u0131rhl\u0131 muhaf\u0131zlar\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131lan zay\u0131f noktalar\u0131n\u0131 hedefle. Ak\u0131nc\u0131lar, cirit\u00e7iler, kalkanl\u0131lar, merdiven ekipleri, s\u0131hhiyeciler ve \u00f6nc\u00fcler ku\u015fatmay\u0131 \u00e7e\u015fitlendirir.\n\u2022 Ate\u015f, buz ve bomba oklar\u0131n\u0131 b\u00f6l\u00fcm boyunca y\u00f6net. Cephane dalga sonunda yenilenmez; her iki kafadan isabet bir \u00f6zel ok kazand\u0131r\u0131r.\n\u2022 Zaferlerle 5 yay ve 5 ok t\u00fcr\u00fc a\u00e7. Dalgalar aras\u0131nda g\u00fc\u00e7 kart\u0131n\u0131 okla se\u00e7; kale tuzaklar\u0131, odak ve \u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc okla sava\u015f\u0131n y\u00f6n\u00fcn\u00fc de\u011fi\u015ftir.\n\u2022 Yay\u0131 istedi\u011fin elle \u00e7ek, k\u0131sa s\u00fcreli de\u011fi\u015fen r\u00fczg\u00e2r\u0131 hesaba kat ve kumanda geri bildirimini hisset. Yerinde durarak ve kademeli d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015fle oyna; men\u00fcden oyunu durdurup te\u00e7hizat ve ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftir.\n\u2022 Deneme Sahas\u0131, tek oyunculu \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 oynan\u0131\u015f, T\u00fcrk\u00e7e ve \u0130ngilizce.\n\nYeni ku\u015fatma videosu ve g\u00f6rselleri, oyun sahnelerinden haz\u0131rlanm\u0131\u015f tan\u0131t\u0131m \u00e7ekimleridir.", "short_description": "Sel\u00e7uklu esintili kaleni ger\u00e7ek bir VR yay\u0131yla savun. 14 b\u00f6l\u00fcm, kule ok\u00e7ular\u0131, manc\u0131n\u0131k bataryalar\u0131 ve farkl\u0131 b\u00f6l\u00fcm liderleriyle y\u00fczle\u015f. Ku\u015fatma ara\u00e7lar\u0131n\u0131n zay\u0131f noktalar\u0131n\u0131 vur; ate\u015f, buz ve bomba oklar\u0131n\u0131 dikkatli kullan. Zaferlerle yeni yay ve oklar a\u00e7. T\u00fcrk\u00e7e ve \u0130ngilizce, tek oyunculu kale savunmas\u0131."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "28450152117986564", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824671_28450152124653230_5164661097279647223_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Sxm_SggxSPEQ7kNvwE86pFV&_nc_oc=Ado9B6EgsvKKVH1157BCW95L9kPDhftFYa3Xim9q9Z2cHpVJoGP_JjW3YvRKRiwOYpM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQnHgM63A2fFGttMBezL_7jqbXU_VJ7H1RYX4cqg23NEQ&oe=6AF88AB8"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440.png", "id": "4531183330504456", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824671_4531183337171122_4171532996689135983_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h_-nwKAOYKYQ7kNvwF3zdC8&_nc_oc=AdqespYbJQ7h1ueQ9lQahomGbjo_NgLn6r6